((date 2026-10-12) (slug index-hedge-screen)
 (hypothesis
  "Index-short overlay screen (pre-registration dev/plans/index-hedge-screen-2026-10-11.md, merged 776e8d355, confirmed by the user; Phase B decision 10 hand-off): does an SPY short held alongside the record long book cut its drawdown and protect the bear periods without giving back the long book's return? Offline overlay ln V*_T = ln V_T + sum_t ln(1 - h g_{t-1} r_SPY,t) - borrow (0.25 %/yr), SPY total return (the short pays dividends), no credit on proceeds. Gates weekly, lagged one week: G1 SPY 30-week Stage 4 (primary), G2 = G1 and macro Bearish, G3 = macro Bearish alone (the Phase B path). h in {0.25, 0.5, 1.0} x NAV. A cell escalates when in >= 2 of 3 salts: (1) 26y combined log >= base - 0.05; (2) combined max DD >= 3 pp smaller; (3) beats base in >= 2 of 3 Phase B bears; (4) adjacent h agree in sign on (1) and (2). Proxy screen: may conclude only escalate or no-build.")
 (base_scenario
  "index-hedge-screen-2026-10-12: offline overlay on the record N equity curves (breadth-fix-rb1-2026-10-11/results/N-rb1-26-s{0,1,2}-v12-equity_curve.csv, V6 PASS every salt), SPY = host data/S/Y/SPY/data.csv adjusted_close (md5 447bca148f4385bcd3b5c19a144f21bf), G1 = stage_chart SPY replay results/spy-weekly-stage.csv, G2/G3 = N macro_trend.sexp trend (233 Bearish weeks, identical across salts), scripts/overlay.awk with the holiday-carry correction; 2000-01-03 -> 2026-06-25")
 (window_id top3000-pitv12-1999-2025-record-26y-3salt-tr-adfull-spy-overlay) (baseline_label N-rb1-26)
