 (notes
  "NO-BUILD DECISION (proxy screen; the overlay was never built, so there is no flag to retire, and this does not license 'index shorts do not work'). 0 of 9 cells escalate: c1 fails everywhere (best G2 h=0.25 -0.0793 vs -0.05), c2 fails everywhere (combined max DD worse in every cell: G2/G3 h=0.25 23.70 / 23.38 / 23.38 % vs base 22.52 / 22.19 / 22.19), c3 holds (G2/G3 3/3 at h<=0.5, G1 2/3 with 2022 negative), c4 vacuous. Sensitivities never pass c2 (credit, +1 week lag, lag+credit, sum form, held short, O frozen-A-D macro); c1 passes only for G2 h=0.25 as a held short (-0.0413) or with lag+credit (-0.0336). WHY: (1) c2 is bounded by the base's own max-DD window 2024-11-26 -> 2026-06-24, where SPY rose +24.6 % (picks drawdown); any bear-gated short adds loss there; of the record's four ~20 % DDs only 2007-10 improves; in the deep bears the macro gate already holds cash (2000-02 base +0.086 vs SPY -0.645). (2) Gate lateness: G1 first on with 16 / 6 / 94 / 31 % of the 2000-02 / 2007-09 / 2020 / 2022 declines done. (3) Rebound bleed: post-trough -0.245 vs bear-leg +0.188 (G1 h=0.25); 2020 alone = 42 % of G1's cost. (4) Costs at h=0.25: daily-rebalancing variance 0.060-0.074, dividends 0.016-0.019, borrow 0.002-0.003. Phase B's -0.30: the G3 overlay at h=0.25 is -0.1765 on O's frozen macro and -0.1541 on N; the breadth fix explains +0.022. Single-name and index shorts stay off; bear protection via shorts closed in both forms. RULE 4 (recommendation, user decides): single-name short book REJECT-do-not-revive; short-only flags short_min_price_on_order_price (#3131), share_class_gate_covers_shorts (#3146), margin_config.short_maintenance_finra (#3148), short_tightened_ratchet_follows_decline (#3145 study arm) eligible after 3 unused sessions; enable_short_side NOT eligible (default true, live weekly 'Short candidates', 202/319 specs inherit; retiring needs a separate default-flip PR); tightened_can_ratchet NOT eligible (long-side topping-zone stop). Does not cover Spy_only_weinstein enable_stage4_short. DEFECTS: overlay.awk dropped the session after each of the curve's 236 US-holiday rows (fixed, verdict unchanged); Week_bucketing keys (week_number, calendar year), splitting year-straddling weeks into two weekly bars; Sharpe marks include the holiday rows. s1/s2 cell aggregates in results/analysis/ledger-metrics-s{1,2}.txt. Writeup dev/experiments/index-hedge-screen-2026-10-12/README.md ## Results."))
